# Build-context exclusions (Lane 5 I4/codex #5).
# The Dockerfile builder does `COPY . .`; without this file the host's
# node_modules (~1.1GB), .next, git history, dumps and secrets all enter the
# build context — slow, and `COPY . .` could overwrite container-installed deps.
# Keep this list in sync with what the build genuinely needs (source + prisma +
# scripts + public); everything below is regenerated in-image or never used at build.
node_modules
mcp/node_modules
.next
.git
.env*
*.log
dumps
staging-initdb
*.sql
*.sql.gz
backup
.claude
docs
